      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Cutaneous endosalpingiosis is a very rare entity, and to our knowledge umbilical location has been reported in only one patient who developed salpingectomy shortly after. We report cutaneous umbilical endosalpingiosis associated with severe abdominal pain that disappeared after surgical treatment."},
